  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under Treas. Reg. Section 1.1502-13(c), gains on intercompany transactions within a consolidated group are deferred and recognized under the matching rule. For depreciable property, the $40,000 deferred gain ($120,000 minus $80,000 basis) is recognized over the asset''s remaining useful life as the buying member claims depreciation on the higher purchase price.
